window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Cleo</b></p> <p><b>Captured by a monster, I was set free by a ruthless enforcer.</b></p> <p>Now, my worst nightmare is back, unrelenting in his pursuit—until my avenging protector roars back into my life. Invading my solace and sanctuary in a world that wants to tear me apart.</p> <p>I don't want him in my cabin, with his obsessively sensual-as-sin, tight-as-fuck body, wild, flaming eyes, and hands and lips that could drive me wild in the single bed we have to share. I don't know what the hell to do with him.</p> <p>He threatens to melt my ice wall and make me moan for him. He demands my heart, but my wounded soul won't let me.</p> <p>I don't want him near me until I see a side of him that's brutal, scorching… and willing to die for me.</p> <p><b>Alessio</b></p> <p><b>She's the beauty I once saved, and I'm obliged to save once more.</b></p> <p>It is my duty to protect her. I'll do whatever it takes to do, even if it means savaging her world... and making her monster's reality a living hell. Driven by my brand of vengeance, I'm underworld-bound. I won't rest until her tormentor is no more.</p> <p>The thing is, she's tough and gives zero f$cks. She's lived hard, most of it alone, and her heart is wounded. I'm obsessed with softening her, making her sigh with desire, and rocking her pain away while she cries out my name when I make love to her with an incandescence she's never imagined. I also won't leave her alone in the wilds of the outback to fight her worst nightmare.</p> <p>She doubts me but doesn't know me. She doesn't understand that I am Omertà; I am Calibrese. I will become the hound of Hades that her monster fears. I'll do whatever it takes... to save her before darkness destroys her.</p> <p><i>From bestselling author Sky Gold, book two of the Kings of Omertà series features a brooding, alpha, morally grey, and sensual mafia enforcer, MMC, and a wounded, defiant FMC. Isolated and alone, with major cabin fever, they fight a common enemy in a dark, spicy, steamy romance where he wars with a vengeance for her heart.</i></p>"; 
